: 3. SERVED BY PERSONAL DELIVERY, OVERNIGHT MAIL, FACSIMILE TRANSMISSION OR EMAIL (state method\nL23@P0: for each person or entity served): Pursuant to F.R.Civ.P. 5 and/or controlling LBR, on (date) _______________, I served\nL24@P0: the following persons and/or entities by personal delivery, overnight mail service, or (for those who consented in writing to\nL25@P0: such service method), by facsimile transmission and/or email as follows. Listing the judge here constitutes a declaration\nL26@P0: that personal delivery on, or overnight mail to, the judge will be completed no later than 24 hours after the document is\nL27@P0: filed.\nL28@P0: Service information continued on attached page\nL29@P0: I declare under penalty of perjury under the laws of the United States that the foregoing is true and correct.\nL30@P0: Date Printed Name Signature\n--------------------------------------------------------------------------------\nInternal Error ()\nciteturn1469view9 [wordlim: 200] Source: click({\"ref_id\":\"turn1435view6\",\"id\":13}); Total lines: 1\nL0: Failed to fetch https://www.ca9.uscourts.gov/forms/EAJA-Fees.pdf: Cache miss\n"
